<title>USA: U.S.'s Lincoln National says completes annuity buy.</title>
<headline>U.S.'s Lincoln National says completes annuity buy.</headline>
<dateline>FORT WAYNE, Ind. 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Lincoln National Corp units said Tuesday they completed their acquisition of the group tax-sheltered annunity business from two UNUM Corp units for about $71 million in cash.</p>
<p>Lincoln National Life Insurance Co and Lincoln Life &amp; Annuity Co, both units of Lincoln National Corp, said they acquired the business from UNUM Life Insurance Co of America and First UNUM Life Insurance Co of New York, affiliates of UNUM Corp.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
